key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: keystore/alpha.jks is intentionally committed — a stable,
# low-stakes self-signed key used only so alpha builds can be installed as
# updates instead of every CI build getting a fresh random signature. Not a
# real release key; see the TODO next to signingConfigs in build.gradle.kts.
!keystore/alpha.jks
